wh40k-warp-instability-global-announcer = Warp
wh40k-warp-instability-global-pulse-500 = Vox traffic drowns in warp static. Lights falter as the veil strains.
wh40k-warp-instability-global-pulse-550 = Whispers seep through the bulkheads. The station answers with voices that are not its own.
wh40k-warp-instability-global-pulse-600 = Cold witchfire races through nearby machinery. Screens flare, relays snap, and the station shudders.
wh40k-warp-instability-global-pulse-650 = The veil thins. Reflections peel away from living bodies and begin to move on their own.
wh40k-warp-instability-global-pulse-700 = A tide of nightmares breaks across the decks. False footsteps and predatory voices flood the corridors.
wh40k-warp-instability-global-pulse-750 = The dead are restless. Corpses twitch, convulse, and rise under the pressure of the warp.
wh40k-warp-instability-global-pulse-800 = The warp storm front hits. Equipment shorts out in violent pulses and the deck groans under the strain.
wh40k-warp-instability-global-pulse-850 = Reality tears open in jagged cuts. Hostile things claw through the breach.
wh40k-warp-instability-global-pulse-900 = Catastrophic overload. The station is drowning in warp pressure and every pulse grows hungrier.
wh40k-warp-instability-global-catastrophe = The veil ruptures. Every soul marked by the warp is burned to ash as a lone cow lumbers through the wound.

