wh40k-psyker-astral-node-anchor-name = Astral Anchor
wh40k-psyker-astral-node-anchor-desc = Unlocks Astral Projection. Baseline path values: 100 maximum Warp, 3/s regeneration, and starting astral depth 1.
wh40k-psyker-astral-node-litany-name = Litany of Control
wh40k-psyker-astral-node-litany-desc = Unlocks Veil of Silence. Astral Projection: 8s -> 6s, 12 -> 7 Warp, emergence 4s -> 3s, entry instability 2 -> 1. All abilities: -8% instability.
wh40k-psyker-astral-node-tether-name = Soul Tether
wh40k-psyker-astral-node-tether-desc = Return window: 1s -> 0.35s. Forced ejection: instability 4 -> 2 and fatigue 20s -> 10s. Additional passive bonuses: +10 maximum Warp and +0.35/s Warp regeneration.
wh40k-psyker-astral-node-kinetic-palm-name = Kinetic Palm
wh40k-psyker-astral-node-kinetic-palm-desc = Unlocks Telekinetic Burst. Burst: 24s -> 20s, 18 -> 15 Warp, instability 6 -> 4. All abilities: -4% cooldowns. Movement speed: +4%.
wh40k-psyker-astral-node-kinetic-bastion-name = Kinetic Bastion
wh40k-psyker-astral-node-kinetic-bastion-desc = Unlocks Psychic Knock. Telekinetic Burst improves to 17s, 15 Warp and 3 instability. Psychic Knock: 12s -> 9s, 10 -> 8 Warp, instability 4 -> 2. Effective health: +5%, incoming damage: -3%.
wh40k-psyker-astral-node-aegis-pattern-name = Aegis Pattern
wh40k-psyker-astral-node-aegis-pattern-desc = Unlocks Aegis Wall. Aegis Wall: 16s -> 14s, 16 -> 15 Warp, instability 6 -> 5 and the wall upgrades to Imperial Tier I. Effective health: +5%, incoming damage: -4%.
wh40k-psyker-astral-node-iron-halo-name = Iron Halo Trace
wh40k-psyker-astral-node-iron-halo-desc = Aegis Wall upgrades to Tier II: 14s -> 11s, cost 15 -> 17 Warp, instability 5 -> 6. Effective health: +8%. Incoming damage: -6%.
wh40k-psyker-astral-node-warp-sense-name = Warp Sense
wh40k-psyker-astral-node-warp-sense-desc = Unlocks Warp Step. Warp Step: 14s -> 11s, 20 -> 17 Warp, instability 8 -> 5. All abilities: -15% instability. Warp regeneration: +0.4/s.
wh40k-psyker-astral-node-thread-reading-name = Thread Reading
wh40k-psyker-astral-node-thread-reading-desc = Unlocks Mind Shunt. Mind Shunt: 150s -> 130s, 30 -> 27 Warp, instability 16 -> 14. All abilities: -10% cooldowns and -10% Warp cost.
wh40k-psyker-astral-node-hemostasis-name = Hemostasis
wh40k-psyker-astral-node-hemostasis-desc = Unlocks Biomantic Surge. Surge restores 36 total health, has a 22s cooldown, costs 14 Warp and adds 4 instability. Passive bonuses: +0.7/s Warp regeneration and +6% effective health.
wh40k-psyker-astral-node-second-pulse-name = Second Pulse
wh40k-psyker-astral-node-second-pulse-desc = Biomantic Surge improves to 54 healing, 18s cooldown, 12 Warp and 3 instability. Passive bonuses: +20 maximum Warp and +8% movement speed.
